WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 35=

01:47.080 --> 01:48.680
Have you heard about His Majesty?

01:51.640 --> 01:52.760
I know he has passed.

01:53.520 --> 01:54.640
Since you already know,

01:54.720 --> 01:55.760
there's something important

01:56.480 --> 01:57.800
I must give you.

01:59.000 --> 01:59.600
What is that?

02:00.480 --> 02:02.720
The late Emperor's edict
to pass the throne to Changjue

02:03.680 --> 02:04.480
is in my residence.

02:10.560 --> 02:11.160
Your Majesty,

02:12.120 --> 02:12.720
Empress Lv

02:13.320 --> 02:15.080
lost her life
to the fire in the Qi palace.

02:16.120 --> 02:17.480
There is unrest in the palace.

02:18.080 --> 02:20.480
Please help stabilize the situation.

02:20.560 --> 02:22.280
A nation cannot
go a day without its ruler.

02:23.040 --> 02:24.720
Otherwise, Beiyuan will plunge
into chaos.

02:27.000 --> 02:28.000
My health

02:28.720 --> 02:30.120
is failing me.

02:32.120 --> 02:33.880
How can I lead?

02:36.240 --> 02:36.840
Your Majesty,

02:38.160 --> 02:39.080
Prince Changjue

02:39.640 --> 02:40.800
has come back to Hao City.

02:41.600 --> 02:42.200
Right.

02:44.440 --> 02:45.880
I still have a son.

02:47.000 --> 02:47.920
He

02:48.600 --> 02:49.720
can be the regent.

02:50.760 --> 02:52.280
If you do not pass the throne to him,

02:53.120 --> 02:55.160
his leadership will be met
with difficulties.

02:55.560 --> 02:57.720
Empress Lv's remaining followers
will give him trouble.

02:59.680 --> 03:01.120
But how can I retire

03:03.680 --> 03:08.320
in peace if I pass
the throne to him now?

03:08.640 --> 03:09.240
Your Majesty,

03:10.760 --> 03:12.680
why don't you pen an edict,

03:14.280 --> 03:15.640
stating that only upon your demise

03:16.480 --> 03:18.440
that the throne will be passed
to His Highness.

03:20.160 --> 03:21.000
Okay.

03:21.720 --> 03:23.320
Eunuch Yu at Imperial Study

03:24.040 --> 03:26.160
can bring me the heirloom seal.

03:45.800 --> 03:46.400
You…

03:47.280 --> 03:47.880
Your Majesty,

03:48.440 --> 03:49.920
I am a person of providence.

03:51.040 --> 03:54.040
We wouldn't want anyone to persuade you
into penning another edict.

03:54.960 --> 04:00.640
Now that the heirloom seal is broken,
this is the only edict you leave behind.

04:02.160 --> 04:03.760
It is no longer safe for me to keep it.

04:04.800 --> 04:05.600
Please come with me.

04:10.800 --> 04:12.280
Your Highness, we can't trust him.

04:16.399 --> 04:18.399
I know I have failed both you

04:18.760 --> 04:19.519
and Empress Helan.

04:20.680 --> 04:22.160
You may kill me now

04:22.760 --> 04:23.760
and I will not protest.

04:24.920 --> 04:25.800
So why didn't you

04:26.760 --> 04:28.280
find a way to give Changjue the edict?

04:29.040 --> 04:30.240
Instead, you went into hiding.

04:31.040 --> 04:33.040
Cui Wei kept a tight watch
on the imperial palace.

04:33.560 --> 04:34.960
He only left last night in a hurry.

04:35.040 --> 04:36.680
I took a risk and snuck into the palace.

04:36.800 --> 04:38.320
Then, I made His Majesty pen the edict.

04:39.480 --> 04:40.560
I tried to find Changjue after

04:40.640 --> 04:41.800
but he is nowhere to be found.

04:44.680 --> 04:45.640
Your Highness, you know

04:46.160 --> 04:47.240
very well what awaits you

04:48.080 --> 04:48.800
and Changjue

04:49.680 --> 04:51.320
once Empress Lv accedes to the throne.

04:56.000 --> 04:56.600
Fine.

04:57.480 --> 04:58.600
I'll come with you.

04:59.800 --> 05:01.800
Don't pull any dirty tricks.

05:02.200 --> 05:02.800
Or

05:03.320 --> 05:04.320
you'll taste my blade.

05:06.600 --> 05:07.640
After you, Your Highness.

05:11.760 --> 05:12.400
Your Highness,

05:12.880 --> 05:14.280
are we truly following him?

05:14.720 --> 05:15.520
If this is a trap,

05:16.000 --> 05:17.200
we will be walking into a trap.

05:18.040 --> 05:18.640
Qingtai,

05:19.600 --> 05:20.960
we've known each other for a while.

05:21.880 --> 05:24.720
If I truly wanted to hurt Her Highness,
I would've done it much sooner.

05:32.800 --> 05:33.400
Chancellor,

05:34.120 --> 05:36.040
Zhan Lu reported that Her Highness

05:36.120 --> 05:38.200
and her attendants went
to meet with Qian Mochen.

05:40.000 --> 05:42.120
Tell everyone to head
to State Preceptor's Residence.

05:42.600 --> 05:43.200
Understood.

05:43.320 --> 05:44.480
I shall meet with you later.

05:55.200 --> 05:55.800
Sir.

06:18.840 --> 06:20.840
Why would you put the edict
in this kind of place?

06:22.200 --> 06:24.160
Your Highness, please be reassured.

06:29.680 --> 06:30.280
Your Highness,

06:31.280 --> 06:32.080
the edict is inside.

06:32.560 --> 06:35.320
As it is an important item,
only you should go inside.

06:40.920 --> 06:42.440
You still think it's a trap.

06:43.600 --> 06:46.080
There's always a catch
behind every sweet promise.

06:46.640 --> 06:48.520
You taught me this back then.

06:48.800 --> 06:51.480
I also taught you that you don't
earn anything

06:51.560 --> 06:53.000
without giving something else away.

06:55.160 --> 06:55.760
Okay.

06:56.200 --> 06:56.840
I'll go inside.

06:58.000 --> 06:58.600
Your Highness!

06:59.360 --> 06:59.960
Qingtai,

07:00.800 --> 07:02.840
you'll wait for me here with Zhan Lu.

07:26.560 --> 07:27.160
(This is)

07:29.160 --> 07:29.760
(the edict.)

07:45.680 --> 07:46.320
(A contraption.)

07:46.960 --> 07:48.440
(The arrow is aiming at…)

08:11.680 --> 08:13.480
What is the meaning
of this, State Preceptor?

08:15.520 --> 08:16.120
Your Highness,

08:17.400 --> 08:18.320
in life,

08:18.480 --> 08:19.560
you cannot have everything.

08:20.920 --> 08:21.880
Take the edict

08:22.320 --> 08:24.400
and the old woman will be killed
by the contraption.

08:34.200 --> 08:38.559
Save her and the edict will
drop into the bonfire and turn to ashes.

08:39.400 --> 08:41.120
So will Changjue's future.

08:41.919 --> 08:43.200
No need to hesitate.

08:44.000 --> 08:46.000
She is but an old peddler by the street.

08:46.120 --> 08:47.960
She is gravely ill
and her days are numbered.

08:49.040 --> 08:50.640
Her life may yet prove some worth

08:51.920 --> 08:53.600
if she can help you get the edict.

09:00.520 --> 09:01.200
Your Highness,

09:01.920 --> 09:03.040
what's taking you so long?

09:04.120 --> 09:06.000
Kill a gravely ill woman

09:06.520 --> 09:07.600
and you'll get the edict

09:08.320 --> 09:09.800
to help Changjue achieve his dream.

09:41.400 --> 09:42.280
Why save me?

09:43.080 --> 09:43.960
To the common folks,

09:44.440 --> 09:45.600
the edict is just a paper.

09:46.520 --> 09:48.120
No life should be sacrificed for it.

09:59.360 --> 10:00.200
Are you all right?

10:00.920 --> 10:01.520
I'm fine.

10:03.480 --> 10:05.920
But the elderly woman inside is weak.

10:06.120 --> 10:07.080
She needs help.

10:09.640 --> 10:10.320
State Preceptor,

10:11.240 --> 10:12.560
what makes you think you can

10:13.080 --> 10:14.600
dictate the life of a commoner?

10:14.680 --> 10:16.480
Why didn't you pick
the edict, Your Highness?

10:18.160 --> 10:19.680
Won't you regret it

10:19.760 --> 10:21.040
if your decision costs Changjue

10:21.440 --> 10:22.240
his future?

10:22.520 --> 10:23.120
I won't.

10:23.840 --> 10:24.760
I have ways

10:25.040 --> 10:27.320
to make Changjue the next
emperor without the final edict.

10:49.520 --> 10:51.360
(Edict)

10:54.520 --> 10:55.200
The final edict.

10:55.680 --> 10:58.800
The final edict
can only be given to someone of integrity.

10:59.720 --> 11:01.400
It was a test.

11:02.400 --> 11:03.240
I wanted to know

11:04.280 --> 11:06.040
that after all this hardship,

11:06.800 --> 11:08.240
is there kindness in you still?

11:08.840 --> 11:10.680
Will you be able to prioritize
your subjects

11:10.920 --> 11:11.920
before absolute power?

11:13.880 --> 11:14.480
Your Highness,

11:16.560 --> 11:17.920
you've always done well.

11:18.720 --> 11:19.320
And today,

11:20.640 --> 11:21.600
you didn't let me down.

11:37.520 --> 11:39.080
What happened to the heirloom seal?

11:39.760 --> 11:40.360
Speak.

11:40.960 --> 11:42.800
Who damaged such a vital artifact?

11:43.360 --> 11:44.440
Forgive me, Your Highness.

11:44.720 --> 11:45.440
Mercy, please.

11:46.120 --> 11:46.720
His Majesty…

11:46.800 --> 11:49.320
His Majesty asked me to bring
the heirloom seal to his chamber.

11:51.600 --> 11:53.440
But what for?

11:56.520 --> 11:58.040
Was there someone else in his chamber?

11:58.560 --> 11:59.800
I wondered too.

12:00.080 --> 12:01.920
I eavesdropped for a while
outside the chamber

12:02.920 --> 12:05.360
and heard someone like State Preceptor.

12:09.840 --> 12:10.880
State Preceptor?

12:16.160 --> 12:16.760
Your Highness,

12:17.920 --> 12:19.000
remember to lay low.

12:19.280 --> 12:20.800
After all, you are easily outnumbered.

12:21.880 --> 12:23.160
Perhaps I should be the one

12:23.320 --> 12:24.120
to locate Changjue.

12:25.000 --> 12:26.560
What if Empress Lv finds out?

12:27.240 --> 12:27.880
I was worried

12:28.520 --> 12:30.920
that Empress Lv might find out
and thus, my plan might fail.

12:31.680 --> 12:33.520
But now that you have the final edict,

12:34.400 --> 12:35.600
nothing holds me back anymore.

12:37.560 --> 12:38.800
State Preceptor, why

12:39.320 --> 12:41.360
did you help my brother and I?

12:44.840 --> 12:46.360
I have never been loyal to Empress Lv.

12:47.920 --> 12:49.840
Yet I was made to make

12:50.920 --> 12:51.720
difficult choices.

12:53.040 --> 12:53.720
I once told you

12:54.280 --> 12:55.600
that right and wrong are nothing

12:55.920 --> 12:56.960
before survival.

12:58.320 --> 12:59.080
I did what I did

12:59.880 --> 13:01.320
to keep you both alive.

13:05.360 --> 13:06.320
I want to thank you,

13:08.600 --> 13:10.120
but I can't find sincerity in my words.

13:11.840 --> 13:13.080
Perhaps I will never understand

13:13.160 --> 13:14.440
your rationale and sacrifice.

13:16.400 --> 13:17.360
(Imperial Edict)

13:17.440 --> 13:18.640
Looking at this edict,

13:19.480 --> 13:21.560
I cannot say I am genuinely
grateful for my father.

13:23.320 --> 13:24.960
He doted on Empress Lv so much

13:26.040 --> 13:27.960
that he neglected Changjue and me.

13:29.280 --> 13:29.920
His Majesty

13:32.320 --> 13:33.520
harbored guilt toward you both

13:34.000 --> 13:35.520
and the late empress.

13:38.720 --> 13:40.560
Thank you for the white lie,
State Preceptor.

13:41.680 --> 13:43.120
I know full well what kind of person

13:44.000 --> 13:45.240
my father was.

13:50.960 --> 13:51.560
Anyone there?

13:51.800 --> 13:52.400
Open the gate.

13:53.080 --> 13:54.760
Her Highness
needs to see State Preceptor.

13:55.760 --> 13:56.600
Open up.

14:01.040 --> 14:04.000
Chancellor, I found Zhan Lu's mark
inside the State Preceptor's Residence.

14:05.160 --> 14:06.320
There's a hidden door behind.

14:07.000 --> 14:08.040
We can sneak in there.

14:18.120 --> 14:19.000
I ask for your patience.

14:19.080 --> 14:20.720
Let me inform State Preceptor at once.

14:20.920 --> 14:21.520
Inside!

14:28.120 --> 14:29.920
Her Highness wants State Preceptor.

14:30.120 --> 14:31.640
Your resistance will be met with death.

14:39.160 --> 14:40.400
Her Highness wants Qian Mochen.

14:40.800 --> 14:42.400
Don't give your life away for nothing.

14:43.440 --> 14:44.320
They're here for me.

14:44.520 --> 14:46.480
I'll have someone take you
to the secret passage.

14:47.120 --> 14:47.720
What about you?

14:48.120 --> 14:49.440
There are contraptions here.

14:49.880 --> 14:50.720
We'll regroup later.

14:51.800 --> 14:52.680
There's a hidden room.

14:52.920 --> 14:53.520
Go inside.

14:55.400 --> 14:56.360
Come. Over there.

15:00.120 --> 15:01.280
Zhan Lu, where's Taohua?

15:27.080 --> 15:27.680
Taohua.

15:37.040 --> 15:37.640
Zaiye,

15:38.440 --> 15:39.080
you're here.

15:40.520 --> 15:41.120
I'm late.

15:49.600 --> 15:52.200
Chancellor Shen, you came all the way
to Beiyuan for Her Highness.

15:52.880 --> 15:53.720
You impressed me.

15:55.240 --> 15:56.480
You flatter me, State Preceptor.

15:58.200 --> 15:58.800
Zaiye,

16:00.360 --> 16:02.120
State Preceptor got this edict

16:02.200 --> 16:03.720
addressed to Changjue from my father.

16:04.360 --> 16:05.080
Let's leave now.

16:05.160 --> 16:06.720
I'll tell you everything once we're out.

16:08.280 --> 16:08.880
Okay.

16:09.080 --> 16:09.760
Qian Mochen,

16:10.520 --> 16:12.520
all your attendants have been captured.

16:13.240 --> 16:14.640
If you want to save them,

16:15.240 --> 16:15.880
show yourself.

16:19.520 --> 16:21.720
(An Chu, Qian Mochen's Confidante)
What do we do now, sir?

16:21.800 --> 16:23.560
Take Her Highness
and Chancellor Shen away.

16:24.320 --> 16:25.320
Remember what I told you.

16:26.440 --> 16:27.080
State Preceptor.

16:29.000 --> 16:30.520
My attendants followed me
for many years.

16:30.600 --> 16:31.680
I won't leave them to die.

16:32.480 --> 16:33.080
Don't worry.

16:33.520 --> 16:35.040
All these years, Empress Lv trusted me.

16:35.480 --> 16:36.800
I have ways to convince her.

16:37.520 --> 16:38.880
I'll contact you once I'm safe.

16:40.440 --> 16:42.400
State Preceptor, show yourself now

16:43.080 --> 16:44.480
or these people will die.

16:45.360 --> 16:46.640
Don't force my hands.

16:48.840 --> 16:50.400
Are you sure you can escape?

16:52.880 --> 16:53.880
Chancellor Shen, you too

16:54.240 --> 16:56.240
have flirted with death many times
over the years.

17:01.040 --> 17:02.080
Take care, State Preceptor.

17:03.640 --> 17:04.240
Farewell.

17:29.520 --> 17:30.120
An Chu,

17:30.960 --> 17:32.080
Cui Wei is a ruthless man.

17:32.480 --> 17:34.080
Let's take the old woman with us.

17:34.600 --> 17:35.200
Okay.

17:47.160 --> 17:49.560
State Preceptor's Residence
is connected to Beiyuan palace.

17:50.560 --> 17:51.960
Qian Mochen is cunning.

17:53.560 --> 17:54.960
Empress Lv could have never imagined

17:55.640 --> 17:56.600
that we fled here.

17:58.240 --> 17:59.800
Your Highness, this is…

18:03.040 --> 18:04.160
The cold palace

18:04.800 --> 18:06.120
Changjue and I grew up in.

18:07.760 --> 18:09.200
Where was the secret passage built?

18:09.280 --> 18:11.680
After Your Highness and Prince Changjue
became his students.

18:11.840 --> 18:13.760
To avoid Empress Lv's detection,

18:14.040 --> 18:16.640
he came
via this secret passage to tutor you.

18:16.880 --> 18:17.880
And despite this passage,

18:19.400 --> 18:21.440
he allowed Changjue and I

18:22.040 --> 18:23.120
to be hunted

18:24.240 --> 18:25.760
like prey

18:26.400 --> 18:27.440
in the palace.

18:29.160 --> 18:29.800
Your Highness,

18:30.200 --> 18:32.320
State Preceptor is sorry
for what he did in the past.

18:32.640 --> 18:33.880
But he did it to save you.

18:34.520 --> 18:37.440
Empress Lv wanted to kill you
when she learned that you were escaping.

18:37.520 --> 18:39.120
Had State Preceptor not feigned loyalty,

18:39.200 --> 18:40.920
you and Prince Changjue
would have been dead.

18:41.000 --> 18:43.400
Then why did he force Her Highness
to take the Jiangtao pill?

18:43.680 --> 18:45.440
Every month, Her Highness endures
toxic pain.

18:45.520 --> 18:46.320
State Preceptor

18:46.400 --> 18:47.760
merely wanted to buy time.

18:48.240 --> 18:50.280
Had he known that there is no antidote,

18:50.440 --> 18:51.720
he wouldn't have done the same.

18:56.480 --> 18:57.200
What?

18:57.760 --> 18:59.080
There is no antidote?

18:59.840 --> 19:00.800
Indeed.

19:01.720 --> 19:03.440
(Mei Ling, Plague Doctor)
I am Mei Ling,

19:03.520 --> 19:05.280
maker of Jiangtao pills.

19:06.280 --> 19:07.240
You work for Empress Lv?

19:08.160 --> 19:09.360
After Empress Lv went missing,

19:09.640 --> 19:10.520
State Preceptor ran into

19:10.600 --> 19:12.840
Physician Mei, who faked her death
to get out of the palace.

19:12.920 --> 19:14.160
He took her into his residence

19:14.240 --> 19:15.080
and interrogated her.

19:15.320 --> 19:15.920
She claimed

19:16.120 --> 19:17.880
that there is no antidote
of Jiangtao pill.

19:19.040 --> 19:20.040
He ran into me?

19:21.600 --> 19:23.720
He planned it.

19:24.240 --> 19:25.720
If there is a monthly relief,

19:26.080 --> 19:27.040
why isn't there a cure?

19:27.840 --> 19:28.720
Who are you?

19:29.880 --> 19:31.280
Who should I tell you?

19:32.600 --> 19:33.720
You faked your death to flee.

19:34.120 --> 19:35.840
That means you don't like Empress Lv.

19:36.360 --> 19:37.160
Enemy of my enemy

19:37.480 --> 19:38.360
is my friend.

19:39.720 --> 19:41.000
I seek your help, Physician Mei.

19:44.720 --> 19:46.480
Since you saved me twice,

19:48.240 --> 19:49.320
I'll help you.

19:50.120 --> 19:51.320
The monthly relief you take

19:51.840 --> 19:53.440
cannot remove the toxin.

19:54.080 --> 19:55.760
It merely suppresses it.

19:56.640 --> 19:59.080
You took the Jiangtao pill
more than two years ago.

20:00.240 --> 20:00.960
Your Highness,

20:01.840 --> 20:03.400
your days are numbered.

20:06.160 --> 20:07.280
I hate owing someone favors.

20:07.880 --> 20:09.960
I will try to find a cure for you.

20:12.600 --> 20:13.600
Please, Physician Mei.

20:15.160 --> 20:16.920
To make Jiangtao pills,

20:17.360 --> 20:19.400
a poisonous flower must be present.

20:20.000 --> 20:21.320
It is a rare flower

20:21.560 --> 20:22.720
called Yinghuo.

20:23.720 --> 20:24.800
Without the flower,

20:25.360 --> 20:28.320
we can only dream of finding a cure.

20:29.720 --> 20:30.880
What does it grow?

20:31.800 --> 20:32.840
According to the records,

20:33.160 --> 20:34.800
it grows in the desert.

20:35.280 --> 20:36.920
Only Empress Lv

20:38.040 --> 20:39.400
knows the exact location.

20:58.400 --> 20:59.000
Zaiye,

21:01.960 --> 21:02.560
it's okay.

21:04.440 --> 21:05.720
We still have time.

21:31.120 --> 21:31.720
Physician Mei,

21:31.840 --> 21:33.720
this shall be your apothecary
for the moment.

21:34.000 --> 21:34.920
Is that okay with you?

21:35.240 --> 21:35.920
Yes.

21:36.720 --> 21:37.320
Do you need

21:37.480 --> 21:38.520
anything else?

21:39.480 --> 21:40.440
Just speak frankly.

21:40.760 --> 21:42.280
Do not beat around the bush.

21:46.120 --> 21:47.160
As you wish.

21:48.000 --> 21:48.840
Physician Mei,

21:49.840 --> 21:50.600
is there truly

21:51.240 --> 21:52.120
no cure

21:52.400 --> 21:53.360
without the flower?

21:54.520 --> 21:56.120
You are keen to search for the cure.

21:56.440 --> 21:57.680
Who is Her Highness to you?

21:59.320 --> 22:00.560
She is my wife,

22:01.080 --> 22:03.000
the person I cherish the most.

22:04.600 --> 22:05.680
We're running out of time,

22:06.040 --> 22:08.080
and it's unsure if we can locate
the Yinghuo flower.

22:09.640 --> 22:11.000
Please let me know

22:11.280 --> 22:12.440
if there's any alternative.

22:13.840 --> 22:15.680
I promise to save her, and so will I.

22:15.960 --> 22:17.480
You don't have to beg me.

22:18.360 --> 22:20.120
I have devised some ways
in the past years

22:20.200 --> 22:21.480
to fight toxin with toxin.

22:22.080 --> 22:23.400
But without Yinghuo flower,

22:24.080 --> 22:26.120
I cannot know how effective it is.

22:26.840 --> 22:28.120
Also, it is possible

22:28.320 --> 22:29.320
to die from the poison

22:29.600 --> 22:31.120
due to the exposure to various toxins.

22:33.240 --> 22:34.600
It's better than waiting around.

22:35.520 --> 22:37.560
Find me some willing testers then.

22:38.120 --> 22:39.000
Where can we

22:39.280 --> 22:40.760
find these people on short notice?

22:43.760 --> 22:44.880
I can be your tester.

22:48.760 --> 22:49.400
Chancellor!

22:57.120 --> 22:59.360
I made the Jiangtao pill.

22:59.800 --> 23:01.760
Once you take it,
it will take effect immediately.

23:02.600 --> 23:04.120
Have you thought this through?

23:06.800 --> 23:08.000
This is the best solution

23:10.240 --> 23:11.480
until we find a Yinghuo flower.

23:13.720 --> 23:16.880
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

23:17.000 --> 23:20.280
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

23:20.640 --> 23:24.200
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

23:24.320 --> 23:27.440
♪With no one it can be brought♪

23:27.520 --> 23:28.560
I just brewed this.

23:28.880 --> 23:30.000
The toxin is not as potent.

23:30.560 --> 23:31.320
Try it.

23:33.160 --> 23:40.160
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

23:40.560 --> 23:42.320
♪Regrets♪

23:43.400 --> 23:44.000
Chancellor!

23:47.880 --> 23:49.640
♪Still I hope♪

23:50.080 --> 23:50.760
Chancellor!

23:50.920 --> 23:55.320
♪She'll pick the flower kissed by dew♪

23:56.480 --> 23:58.160
(So it was this painful)

23:59.160 --> 24:00.800
(whenever the poison ravaged your body.)

24:06.600 --> 24:07.200
This is…

24:08.920 --> 24:10.240
Her Highness wants to get changed.

24:10.760 --> 24:12.840
I am sending some robes to Her Highness.

24:17.720 --> 24:18.720
Give them to me.

24:19.000 --> 24:20.640
♪At her command♪

24:20.720 --> 24:24.120
♪Longing to stand against the loneliness♪

24:24.800 --> 24:27.680
♪The petals fall, gone in a blink♪

24:27.760 --> 24:29.640
(You've been enduring such agony)

24:31.040 --> 24:32.720
(every day.)

24:34.080 --> 24:35.120
(I saw your suffering,)

24:36.320 --> 24:37.600
(but I never cared.)

24:38.800 --> 24:40.480
♪The flower withers♪

24:40.640 --> 24:42.040
You ladies are weird.

24:42.760 --> 24:44.120
Why would you draw a peach blossom

24:44.840 --> 24:45.880
on your arm?

24:46.440 --> 24:47.760
You'll never understand us ladies,

24:47.960 --> 24:49.000
Chancellor Shen.

24:51.400 --> 24:58.120
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

24:58.920 --> 25:05.000
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

25:06.120 --> 25:08.960
♪Still I hope♪

25:09.840 --> 25:10.520
Chancellor Shen,

25:11.480 --> 25:12.240
I must return.

25:13.000 --> 25:13.600
Goodbye.

25:15.160 --> 25:20.640
♪Even if it means this flower
will be hers to give to someone new♪

25:20.720 --> 25:27.360
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

25:27.840 --> 25:33.640
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

25:33.800 --> 25:34.520
Physician Mei,

25:35.320 --> 25:36.560
did the poison weaken?

25:39.320 --> 25:40.600
Not at all.

25:42.600 --> 25:47.680
♪And finding they were♪

25:47.760 --> 25:48.440
Continue.

25:48.520 --> 25:52.480
♪Her gentle heart's reply♪

25:55.800 --> 25:57.440
Your Highness,
Imperial Guard Hu is here.

25:58.560 --> 25:59.560
Greetings, Your Highness.

25:59.840 --> 26:00.560
At ease.

26:02.200 --> 26:03.320
You are Imperial Guard Hu?

26:03.480 --> 26:04.280
Yes, Your Highness.

26:04.600 --> 26:06.320
(Hu Yun, follower of Deputy Chief Yue)
I am Hu Yun, follower of Deputy Chief Yue.

26:08.040 --> 26:09.520
I have heard about your master.

26:10.360 --> 26:11.720
I have no way to return his favor.

26:13.000 --> 26:14.160
Hence, please accept this bow

26:14.480 --> 26:16.000
on behalf of your master.

26:16.440 --> 26:17.080
Your Highness,

26:17.400 --> 26:18.040
don't do this.

26:19.080 --> 26:19.680
Your Highness,

26:20.240 --> 26:21.480
Deputy Chief Yue often told me

26:21.800 --> 26:22.920
that his biggest regret

26:23.240 --> 26:24.920
was failing to protect you
and Prince Changjue.

26:25.000 --> 26:26.920
That's why both of you
had to seek refuge outside.

26:27.000 --> 26:28.520
Now that His Highness has returned,

26:29.000 --> 26:30.400
he would do anything

26:30.640 --> 26:31.440
for His Highness

26:31.880 --> 26:33.280
and Beiyuan.

26:35.280 --> 26:36.480
He is indeed a loyal servant.

26:37.960 --> 26:39.440
Your Highness, I am ashamed to admit

26:39.880 --> 26:41.560
that I failed to carry out
my master's order

26:41.640 --> 26:42.680
and protect His Highness.

26:43.240 --> 26:44.040
It's not your fault.

26:45.000 --> 26:45.600
Besides,

26:46.120 --> 26:48.160
Empress Lv doesn't have Changjue.

26:48.440 --> 26:49.400
We still stand a chance.

26:49.840 --> 26:50.560
Oh, Your Highness,

26:51.080 --> 26:53.560
His Highness and I once agreed
to hide in a secret abode

26:53.640 --> 26:54.600
if something happened.

26:54.720 --> 26:57.000
I shall wait for His Highness there
in the days to come.

26:57.880 --> 27:00.280
Empress Lv is searching for Changjue
everywhere in the city.

27:01.360 --> 27:03.800
He probably cannot travel easily.

27:04.440 --> 27:06.400
We should search around the secret abode

27:06.680 --> 27:07.360
to take him in.

27:07.760 --> 27:08.560
Yes, Your Highness.

27:14.880 --> 27:15.720
Lift his head.

27:19.320 --> 27:20.440
What did you do?

27:21.800 --> 27:23.680
How could you torture

27:24.080 --> 27:25.520
our handsome State Preceptor?

27:27.120 --> 27:28.720
Rinse him.

27:38.480 --> 27:40.000
You have fine humor, State Preceptor.

27:40.680 --> 27:43.000
You find joy under these circumstances.

27:43.400 --> 27:44.680
How admirable.

27:46.040 --> 27:47.000
Unfortunately for you,

27:47.880 --> 27:49.240
you pledged your loyalty

27:49.760 --> 27:50.760
to the wrong person.

27:55.480 --> 27:58.120
The poison will trigger
in a few days.

27:59.000 --> 28:00.040
Give me the final edict

28:01.000 --> 28:03.440
and I shall give you the cure
to Jiangtao pill.

28:04.560 --> 28:05.920
If only

28:08.440 --> 28:09.600
there was a cure.

28:11.160 --> 28:12.120
How did you know?

28:13.920 --> 28:15.680
I am as good as dead.

28:17.200 --> 28:19.000
I don't need to act
in front of you anymore.

28:27.440 --> 28:29.960
Since you refuse to cooperate,

28:30.840 --> 28:32.760
I'll just have to use you

28:33.200 --> 28:34.280
as the bait.

28:34.840 --> 28:35.880
What are you going to do?

28:37.040 --> 28:37.640
Cui Wei,

28:40.040 --> 28:41.520
put up notices in the city.

28:42.320 --> 28:45.640
Tell them Qian Mochen will be beheaded
in three days.

28:46.680 --> 28:49.360
Then, leak the information
that he is kept in the imperial prison.

28:50.360 --> 28:50.960
Noted.

28:51.280 --> 28:52.080
State Preceptor,

28:52.960 --> 28:54.600
you know Jiang Changjue
better than I do.

28:55.480 --> 28:58.240
If he was kind enough to help
the incriminated children in Luocheng,

28:58.800 --> 29:01.000
perhaps he'll come to save you,

29:01.600 --> 29:03.040
since you were his tutor,

29:03.800 --> 29:05.240
and you got the edict

29:05.320 --> 29:06.400
for him.

29:08.120 --> 29:09.680
Once I get rid of him,

29:10.000 --> 29:12.560
the edict is but a paper.

29:14.120 --> 29:15.000
I despise you.

29:16.960 --> 29:18.520
(Notice)
State Preceptor committed treason

29:18.600 --> 29:20.680
by colluding with the enemy
and insulted Her Highness.

29:21.320 --> 29:22.760
He will be beheaded in three days.

29:24.240 --> 29:24.920
What?

29:26.000 --> 29:26.840
How could this be?

29:28.160 --> 29:29.520
He is such a kind official.

29:29.960 --> 29:31.280
What happened to him?

29:32.280 --> 29:33.000
Why?

29:33.080 --> 29:33.680
(Notice)

29:33.760 --> 29:34.360
Disgusting.

29:34.440 --> 29:35.200
He is a traitor.

29:35.360 --> 29:36.080
He deserves it.

29:36.840 --> 29:38.120
Insulting Her Highness

29:38.200 --> 29:39.440
shows that he is not a traitor.

29:39.720 --> 29:40.680
He is a good person.

29:42.080 --> 29:42.680
Are you crazy?

29:42.760 --> 29:43.640
The one with the hat,

29:44.080 --> 29:44.680
turn over.

29:45.120 --> 29:45.880
I'm talking to you.

29:46.800 --> 29:47.400
Stay there.

29:52.720 --> 29:53.800
Nowhere to run now.

30:00.760 --> 30:01.360
Taohua?

30:12.360 --> 30:13.800
His Highness is back.

30:15.600 --> 30:16.880
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

30:16.960 --> 30:17.560
Your Highness.

30:19.520 --> 30:21.280
Your Highness,
we've been waiting for you here.

30:21.360 --> 30:22.400
You have finally returned.

30:22.480 --> 30:24.040
Your Highness, I'm so happy you're safe.

30:25.000 --> 30:27.080
My people, Father wrote his last edict

30:27.360 --> 30:28.400
before he passed away

30:29.080 --> 30:30.800
to pass the throne to Changjue.

30:31.480 --> 30:32.920
Once we reclaim the imperial palace,

30:33.480 --> 30:34.160
Changjue

30:34.720 --> 30:36.800
will be Beiyuan's rightful ruler.

30:38.800 --> 30:39.440
Yes!

30:48.680 --> 30:50.760
- Greetings, Your Majesty.
- Greetings, Your Majesty.

30:53.760 --> 30:54.520
At ease.

30:55.080 --> 30:55.680
Taohua.

31:06.760 --> 31:07.360
Taohua,

31:08.160 --> 31:08.840
I've missed you.

31:10.320 --> 31:11.680
Me too.

31:12.640 --> 31:13.520
Let me look at you.

31:13.600 --> 31:14.560
Are you hurt?

31:14.640 --> 31:16.280
Worry not, Taohua.

31:16.920 --> 31:17.920
I am a tough guy.

31:18.760 --> 31:19.480
I am fine.

31:20.760 --> 31:21.360
Taohua,

31:22.320 --> 31:22.960
what's with

31:24.440 --> 31:25.400
this final edict?

31:26.360 --> 31:27.320
Our tutor

31:28.200 --> 31:29.240
gave it to us.

31:30.240 --> 31:30.960
Qian Mochen?

31:32.560 --> 31:33.760
Doesn't he work for Empress Lv?

31:35.760 --> 31:37.080
He has been working

31:37.560 --> 31:38.840
with Deputy Chief Yue in secret

31:39.240 --> 31:40.080
to help you.

31:40.600 --> 31:42.120
And those officials that you contacted

31:42.400 --> 31:43.800
were paths paved by him.

31:44.360 --> 31:45.920
And he obtained this edict

31:46.560 --> 31:47.880
from Father.

31:50.920 --> 31:51.920
I see now.

31:52.920 --> 31:54.480
No wonder there's a notice on the street

31:55.280 --> 31:57.160
saying that he will be beheaded
in three days.

31:57.760 --> 31:59.000
Empress Lv is killing him?

32:00.760 --> 32:01.880
What's the matter, Taohua?

32:02.880 --> 32:03.760
I'm fine.

32:11.160 --> 32:13.320
Why do you bear such a mark, Taohua?

32:14.240 --> 32:15.000
I found this mark

32:15.240 --> 32:17.120
on Empress Lv's death warriors
in Luocheng.

32:21.840 --> 32:23.320
It means the poison is taking effect.

32:24.840 --> 32:26.320
You were poisoned by Empress Lv.

32:26.600 --> 32:27.680
You were a death warrior.

32:32.440 --> 32:33.160
That Empress Lv!

32:33.840 --> 32:35.920
Isn't it enough to marry you off
to a faraway nation?

32:37.320 --> 32:39.080
Does she have no heart?

32:41.800 --> 32:42.960
This edict is not important

32:43.280 --> 32:44.600
as your life, Taohua.

32:45.000 --> 32:46.080
I will raid the palace,

32:46.760 --> 32:47.560
capture Empress Lv,

32:47.880 --> 32:48.960
and get the cure for you.

32:49.400 --> 32:50.000
Changjue,

32:51.080 --> 32:52.000
do not be rash.

32:54.640 --> 32:55.320
Do you know?

32:56.160 --> 32:56.920
I thought

32:58.120 --> 32:59.640
I had a miserable life

33:00.680 --> 33:02.160
in Luocheng.

33:03.320 --> 33:04.600
But compared to you,

33:05.840 --> 33:07.000
my suffering is nothing.

33:08.000 --> 33:08.840
Changjue,

33:10.040 --> 33:12.080
I am leading a comfortable life in Qi.

33:13.760 --> 33:15.320
Although I have this poison in me,

33:16.000 --> 33:16.720
I ingest

33:17.200 --> 33:18.520
a herbal relief every month.

33:19.560 --> 33:21.640
Empress Lv and we are sworn enemies now.

33:22.320 --> 33:23.840
They won't give us the relief anymore.

33:25.760 --> 33:28.040
I still have some leftovers.

33:31.080 --> 33:31.920
Show me.

33:33.800 --> 33:35.240
I don't have them with me right now.

33:36.760 --> 33:37.360
Taohua,

33:38.880 --> 33:40.320
if you're lying to me,

33:41.240 --> 33:42.800
I'll head straight to the palace

33:43.280 --> 33:45.040
and get Empress Lv
to give you the antidote.

33:45.440 --> 33:46.200
Changjue,

33:49.080 --> 33:51.000
I don't have
the herbal relief with me anymore.

33:53.960 --> 33:54.560
Taohua.

34:02.480 --> 34:03.880
My days are numbered,

34:04.960 --> 34:06.680
but our tutor is in danger.

34:07.400 --> 34:08.880
We can't leave him to die.

34:12.000 --> 34:12.760
But…

34:13.400 --> 34:14.239
Changjue.

34:19.040 --> 34:19.639
My friends,

34:19.800 --> 34:21.159
I have news of the State Preceptor.

34:25.360 --> 34:26.280
Your Highnesses,

34:26.360 --> 34:27.880
I discovered
that prior to the execution,

34:27.960 --> 34:29.960
State Preceptor
will be held in the imperial prison.

34:31.159 --> 34:33.760
Taohua,
we must save him as soon as possible.

34:36.040 --> 34:37.000
Your Highnesses,

34:37.600 --> 34:39.000
if I may be frank,

34:39.360 --> 34:41.040
my master once told me

34:41.360 --> 34:42.639
that should Empress Lv capture him,

34:42.719 --> 34:44.679
both of you were to not risk your lives
for him.

34:44.880 --> 34:45.480
That's because

34:46.560 --> 34:48.000
he's about to die too.

34:49.320 --> 34:50.360
How come?

34:51.120 --> 34:52.719
To obtain Empress Lv's trust,

34:53.600 --> 34:55.239
he volunteered
to take the Jiangtao pill.

34:59.600 --> 35:01.080
I have never been loyal to Empress Lv.

35:02.640 --> 35:03.560
Right and wrong

35:04.040 --> 35:05.160
are nothing before survival.

35:06.400 --> 35:07.160
I did what I did

35:07.720 --> 35:09.200
to keep you both alive.

35:10.040 --> 35:10.640
Farewell.

35:11.480 --> 35:12.520
Take care, State Preceptor.

35:28.720 --> 35:29.320
At ease.

35:32.320 --> 35:32.920
To us,

35:33.960 --> 35:36.040
he is our mentor.

35:37.200 --> 35:37.800
To the nation,

35:38.720 --> 35:40.080
he is an important official.

35:40.760 --> 35:43.840
If he dies to Empress Lv,
that will sow fear to other officials.

35:44.520 --> 35:45.120
And then,

35:45.640 --> 35:46.960
no one will dare defy Empress Lv.

35:47.680 --> 35:49.200
Beiyuan will fall into tyranny.

35:50.000 --> 35:50.600
Therefore,

35:51.520 --> 35:53.040
we must save him.

35:54.000 --> 35:54.600
Yes.

35:54.680 --> 35:55.320
We must save him.

35:55.400 --> 35:56.720
- We must save him.
- We must save him.

35:56.800 --> 35:58.800
- Patience, please.
- We must save him.

35:58.920 --> 35:59.800
We need a plan.

36:03.440 --> 36:04.520
You must be Chancellor Shen.

36:04.640 --> 36:05.960
We're not at Qi at the moment.

36:06.160 --> 36:07.480
You'd be wise to stay out of this.

36:07.800 --> 36:09.680
How did you find out
that State Preceptor

36:09.760 --> 36:11.000
was held in the imperial prison?

36:12.080 --> 36:13.840
A friend in the imperial prison told me.

36:14.680 --> 36:15.320
Two days ago,

36:15.480 --> 36:17.720
Cui Wei escorted State Preceptor
to the prison in secret.

36:18.320 --> 36:18.960
Can he be trusted?

36:19.040 --> 36:20.960
I trust him. We have been friends
for ten years.

36:21.960 --> 36:22.560
Okay.

36:22.920 --> 36:23.880
Can you do me a favor?

36:28.080 --> 36:29.080
The food is here.

36:32.200 --> 36:33.080
Give me some rice.

36:35.840 --> 36:37.480
- Give me more.
- Give me more.

36:39.920 --> 36:40.640
Do not fight.

36:50.840 --> 36:53.000
I saw State Preceptor in the prison
with my own eyes.

36:53.640 --> 36:54.760
I couldn't take a good look,

36:55.200 --> 36:57.560
but he looked like State Preceptor
as shown in the portrait.

36:58.360 --> 36:59.960
I suppose we must break into the prison.

37:06.080 --> 37:07.080
What's the matter, Zaiye?

37:09.080 --> 37:09.800
Tell me everything

37:10.160 --> 37:11.640
you saw in great detail.

37:13.840 --> 37:15.640
He was held in a solitary cell.

37:17.040 --> 37:19.160
His meal was made privately.

37:19.760 --> 37:20.400
He was eating?

37:21.440 --> 37:23.280
Did you see how he ate?

37:23.360 --> 37:24.400
Just like a normal person.

37:24.480 --> 37:27.120
He held a bowl with his left hand,
and chopsticks with his right.

37:27.440 --> 37:28.040
No.

37:29.800 --> 37:31.680
He usually holds chopsticks
with his left hand.

37:32.080 --> 37:33.880
The man in the cell
is not State Preceptor.

37:35.920 --> 37:37.480
It's a trap then.

37:40.120 --> 37:40.800
That means

37:41.800 --> 37:43.200
Empress Lv is using State Preceptor

37:43.600 --> 37:44.800
as bait to lure Changjue out.

37:46.440 --> 37:47.200
I apologize.

37:47.920 --> 37:49.160
Were it not for both of your

37:49.240 --> 37:50.200
keen sense,

37:50.640 --> 37:52.720
we would have all fallen
for Empress Lv's trap.

37:54.760 --> 37:55.560
If

37:56.520 --> 37:58.080
he isn't in the imperial prison,

37:59.000 --> 38:00.120
where could he be?

38:07.200 --> 38:09.080
All of you have fought Empress Lv
for many years.

38:09.160 --> 38:10.800
What would you say is her biggest trait?

38:12.760 --> 38:13.520
She's megalomaniac.

38:14.840 --> 38:15.520
Distrustful,

38:16.240 --> 38:17.080
and cruel.

38:20.680 --> 38:21.320
I have a plan.

38:23.680 --> 38:25.160
She doesn't know Taohua and I

38:25.240 --> 38:25.880
are at Hao City.

38:27.160 --> 38:28.040
Imagine that she knows

38:28.520 --> 38:29.560
that we're here,

38:30.000 --> 38:32.120
yet we haven't sent in anyone
to save State Preceptor.

38:32.680 --> 38:33.360
Instead,

38:33.800 --> 38:35.800
we try to buy time outside
of the imperial prison,

38:35.920 --> 38:37.080
what will she think of it?

38:38.200 --> 38:39.280
She'll assume

38:39.960 --> 38:40.840
that we know

38:40.920 --> 38:42.360
State Preceptor's whereabouts.

38:43.280 --> 38:44.600
She'll have someone check on him,

38:44.680 --> 38:45.960
or even check on him personally.

38:47.080 --> 38:48.280
We just have to tail them

38:48.640 --> 38:49.760
to find out where he is.

38:50.880 --> 38:51.480
Good.

38:52.840 --> 38:53.960
But this is a dangerous plan.

38:54.560 --> 38:56.320
We are easily outnumbered
by her people.

38:56.760 --> 38:58.080
Be very cautious.

38:58.520 --> 38:59.120
- Yes.
- Yes.

39:01.440 --> 39:02.160
Whatever it takes,

39:03.000 --> 39:04.880
we have to rescue him tomorrow

39:05.320 --> 39:06.320
and capture Empress Lv.

39:06.680 --> 39:08.480
Then, we force her
to surrender the antidote.

39:40.040 --> 39:41.360
Let me warn you

39:41.880 --> 39:43.560
that this is a potent poison.

39:44.560 --> 39:45.760
Are you sure about it?

39:48.000 --> 39:48.640
Chancellor,

39:49.480 --> 39:51.360
can we do this
after we rescue State Preceptor

39:51.720 --> 39:52.960
and capture Empress Lv tomorrow?

39:53.040 --> 39:54.560
Perhaps we can get the Yinghuo flower

39:55.000 --> 39:55.760
from her.

39:57.280 --> 39:58.640
We have a tough fight tomorrow.

39:59.080 --> 40:01.200
Rescuing State Preceptor
is already a tremendous task.

40:02.600 --> 40:03.840
If we fail to capture Empress Lv

40:03.920 --> 40:05.200
and find the Yinghuo flower,

40:05.480 --> 40:06.520
having another day

40:07.360 --> 40:07.960
to test

40:08.200 --> 40:09.920
the antidote might expedite
Physician Mei's

40:10.440 --> 40:11.320
research.

40:28.800 --> 40:29.400
Chancellor.

40:32.760 --> 40:33.400
Chancellor!

40:34.800 --> 40:36.600
Physician Mei, did we fail again?

40:36.680 --> 40:37.920
Another failed attempt.

40:39.000 --> 40:41.280
I am unable to find a replacement
for the Yinghuo flower.

40:52.240 --> 40:53.720
I will find the flower.

40:55.440 --> 40:57.160
Please don't give up, Physician Mei.

40:57.760 --> 40:59.160
Let's continue.

41:00.040 --> 41:01.600
There are too many toxins in your body,

41:01.680 --> 41:03.440
not to mention the toxin
from Jiangtao pill.

41:04.080 --> 41:05.160
You might die anytime soon,

41:05.360 --> 41:07.000
let alone testing another poison.

41:08.960 --> 41:09.560
Chancellor,

41:10.440 --> 41:11.520
is she truly worth

41:11.600 --> 41:12.560
your life?

41:19.560 --> 41:20.160
Yes.

41:34.680 --> 41:35.480
(Empress Lv,)

41:36.480 --> 41:38.560
(for the pain you inflict on us both,)

41:39.440 --> 41:41.080
(I will make you pay,)

41:41.760 --> 41:43.400
(even at the expense of my life.)

41:59.960 --> 42:03.160
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

42:03.240 --> 42:06.280
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

42:07.200 --> 42:10.320
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

42:10.440 --> 42:14.200
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

42:14.480 --> 42:17.560
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

42:17.680 --> 42:21.000
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

42:21.400 --> 42:24.960
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

42:25.040 --> 42:30.760
♪With no one it can be brought♪

42:35.720 --> 42:42.640
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

42:43.080 --> 42:49.920
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

42:50.400 --> 42:57.400
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

42:57.720 --> 43:01.760
♪Even if it means this flower♪

43:01.880 --> 43:08.840
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

43:19.960 --> 43:23.080
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

43:23.160 --> 43:26.400
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

43:26.760 --> 43:30.440
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

43:30.560 --> 43:37.120
♪No longer needing to say♪

43:41.200 --> 43:48.120
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

43:48.520 --> 43:55.480
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

43:55.840 --> 44:02.840
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

44:03.200 --> 44:04.880
♪And finding♪

44:04.960 --> 44:11.960
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
